Paths constrained with different clocks

There are paths in the design that are constrained by two different clocks, and 
the relationship between the periods is not an integer multiple. Verify that    
the periods of the clocks were defined correctly.  The following command can be 
used to report a path for which this occurs:                                    
report timing -from <launch_clock> -to <capture_clock>
Use 'report clocks' for more information about the individual clocks            

