-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Exceptions with invalid timing start-/endpoints

The following timing exceptions have -from points that are not valid timing     
startpoints or -to points that are not valid timing endpoints.  If the          
exception was intended to constrain paths that pass through these points, the   
-through option should be used instead when creating the timing exception.  If  
these points were specified inadvertantly, the exception should be re-written   
to not include them.  Currently these exception points are being ignored.       

